# ── WalletConnect / Reown AppKit (desktop + browser wallet execution) ─────────
# Public Project ID from https://cloud.reown.com (or the legacy WalletConnect
# Cloud). It is safe to commit: it is a public identifier only, not a secret.
# Leave it empty to use the hardcoded fallback constant in
# apps/web/src/wallet/config.ts (so the bundled desktop .exe still runs).
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=b01fc9a889c7da0e31bbd1d17aafca1f

# ── Alchemy API Key (on-chain data fetching: prices, balances, block numbers) ──
# Alchemy RPC key for reading on-chain data (Uniswap pool prices, ERC20
# balances, block numbers). When configured, the app uses Alchemy's endpoints
# instead of public RPCs — more reliable rate limits + dashboard analytics.
#
# Get a free key at https://dashboard.alchemy.com — it is safe to commit IF
# you restrict it by domain in the Alchemy dashboard (Settings → Security).
# Leave empty to use public RPC fallbacks (less reliable, no analytics).
#
# The bundled desktop .exe ships with a hardcoded fallback key so it works
# out-of-the-box; replace VITE_ALCHEMY_API_KEY here or in config.ts to use
# your own key.
VITE_ALCHEMY_API_KEY=alch_1putSHNWM5T5cGU_cCMa3

# ── Web3 & Network Configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# (Shared with the orchestrator / Rust engine via the monorepo root .env)
NETWORK_NAME=sepolia
RPC_WEBSOCKET_URL=
RPC_HTTP_URL=
